The CSV files were obtained from the original fz-nophone.arff available at:
https://www.cs.utexas.edu/~ml/riddle/data.html.

* fodors_zagat_nophone_ids contains distinct (clean-clean) records
* fodors_zagat_nophone_cluster_mapping contains the original clusters inferred
  from the 'class' attribute of the original dataset
* fodors_zagat_nophone_mapping contains the ideal mapping for record
  linkage/duplicate detection obtained by providing the pairwise combinations
  of records contained by the clusters
